# Reading participles in Russian: работающий, бывший
subtitle: "A notice in Tom's entrance is full of participles: learn to read живущий, работающий and бывший as a short который."
tags: ["russian","russian participles","reading russian","бывший","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/participles","reading/reading-signs"]
thumb: "band \"Reading participles in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Closed and sold out in Russian: закрыто, продано","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/126-russian-participles-passive.cast"}

