      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Да́льше. Watch the ending.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:jb55ak'
    '|a||Ни́на Петро́вна — сосе́дка, живу́щая здесь. Кото́рая живёт здесь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5240
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Now say it the long way, with кото́рый.':
