      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:sfw8bx'
    '|a||Напиши́те with кото́рый: студе́нты, прие́хавшие из Москвы́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1yi86g4'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Прие́хавшие: кото́рые прие́хали.':
